  "details": "Now I get it, there are tags. But some of the avatars add toggles to the \"naughty\" content. So how about you give us an option to add toggles for 18+ only? And so for worlds.\n\nIt will make it even safer. Because apparently people who haven't verified yet, can still access that kind of content.\n\nSo it will be better to add another security measure, to let the content creators add features in their avatars / worlds, that are togglable ONLY if you're verified.",
